WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:10.320
Your website is the first broken loop. Pages that crawl. Forms that go nowhere. No way to book.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.420
So the lead leaves before you ever hear from them. You fix the ads or you fix the site,

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.660
but the leak stays. The site and the system behind it are one job.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:27.860
Worry not, I'm here to close your loop. Here's what I build. A site that loads fast reads clearly and asks for one thing.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:32.740
A real booking flow wired to a real calendar. A form that lands somewhere,

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.940
routed and followed up, not an inbox nobody reads.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:42.140
Reminders that go out on time. And the systems layer labeled so you can see what runs behind it.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.980
Site and system. One handover. You keep every account and credential.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:56.580
Heating and cooling. A two-in-the-morning emergency call, booked online, towing phone, first dispatch, and one monthly statement for fleet accounts.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:01.260
Cabin rentals: availability that answers before the guest closes the tab.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:08.860
Dental: text-first intake and reminders that keep the chair full. If your website is where the lead leaks,

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:14.940
let's close that loop. Book a systems audit now or send me an email. Talk to you soon.
